Recommends: wlanpi-menud
Description: WLAN Pi menu terminal client
 Textual thin-mode client for wlanpi-menud, run from an SSH session. It
 connects to /run/wlanpi-menud/local.sock and renders the same menu as the
 front panel and the WebUI. Users in the wlanpi-menud group may connect.
 .
 No service, no network listener, no hardware access.
